      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِرْعٌ مَأْرُوقٌ</span></b>  <i>Seed-produce affected,</i> or <i>smitten,
with a blight,</i> or <i>disease,</i> (JK, S, K,) <i>such as is
termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَقَان</span>; (JK, S;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَيْرُوقٌ</span> [from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرَقَان</span>]:
(S, K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْلَةٌ مَأْرُوقَةٌ</span> <i>a palm-tree affected,</i> or
<i>smitten, therewith.</i> (JK, TA.)

